# MedSync Health, Inc.
## Win/Loss Analysis Report
**FY 2024**

**Document ID**: SALES-010
**Classification**: Internal - Confidential
**Date**: January 2025

---

## Executive Summary

MedSync achieved a 33% win rate in FY 2024, up from 30% in FY 2023. Key wins were driven by multi-EHR positioning and speed-to-value. Primary loss factors were budget timing and Epic/Cerner incumbency.

